Student 2: What is your assessment of the assignment? Was it helpful?
Was it fun?

This was a very overwhelming assignment, especially because other courses 
that many students take concurrently have heavy load assignments or exams 
around the same period (ORF309, ECE206). This would have been way more fun 
if we had more time to do it. It was helpful in making me understand the 
gdb better, and really forced me to be creative and think about invariants. 
It felt like a brainstorming process, just listing every single thing we 
could think of and then eliminating the ones that were not actually 
invariants or that overlapped.


